        "original_id": "aa2baf11-5b5d-51f2-97b8-1a3aeecac267",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Timothy Björklund, Debra Jo Rupp\n- Works: Teacher's Pet, Teacher's Pet (2004 film), Big (1988)\n- Awards: Golden Satellite Award\n- Topics: animated films, television series adaptations, voice acting\n\nFacts:\n- In 1988, Debra Jo Rupp played the timid secretary Miss Patterson in the film \"Big.\"\n- In 2004, \"Teacher's Pet\" was released as an American animated musical comedy film based on the television series of the same name.\n- In 2004, the film \"Teacher's Pet\" concluded the central storyline of the \"Teacher's Pet\" television series.\n- Debra Jo Rupp voiced Mary Helperman in the animated series \"Teacher's Pet\" and in its sequel film \"Teacher's Pet.\"\n- In 2005, Timothy Björklund's only movie to date, \"Teacher's Pet,\" was nominated for a Golden Satellite Award.",
